More donations. $2 here. $3 there. A $10 drop from someone named MidnightWhale99 that comes with a message:

$10.00 from MidnightWhale99: "Something about your voice just makes me want to listen. Instant sub."

MidnightWhale99. The name from the GDD   the name that becomes important later. I file it away without knowing why, the way you notice a stranger's face in a crowd and can't explain the noticing.

<<chat "ElliePlayz" "MidnightWhale, oh my gosh, TEN DOLLARS? You're insane! Thank you so much! I literally don't know what to say!">>

<<chat "MidnightWhale99" "just keep talking. that's enough 🙂">>

Just keep talking. That's enough. A stranger on the internet just told a voice without a face that existing is sufficient. That the voice alone   the manufactured, modulated, pitch-shifted voice   is worth ten dollars and a subscription.

I play another match. 6 and 5. Positive K/D. The chat celebrates like I won a championship:

<<chat "stream_viewer_a12" "POSITIVE KD LETS GOOOOO">>

<<chat "stream_viewer_a2" "ELLIE CRACKED">>

