The stream goes live. The webcam activates. In the preview, a pair of large, lash-framed eyes and a cascade of brownish-auburn waves appear beside the game capture window, and the VoxMorph hums softly as it processes my breathing into something softer.

<<eli  "Hiii! I'm back! Oh my gosh, hi everyone! I said I'd stream again tonight and here I am! I even have a little bit of camera now   I know I know, it's not a full face reveal, but you can see my eyes and my hair! Progress, right? How is everyone?">>

Viewers: 3

