Viewers: 15

They come back. The people from this afternoon   I can see the usernames, ChillVibesOnly and MidnightWhale99 and night_owl_cc, returning like regulars to a bar, settling into the chat with the easy familiarity of people who've found something they want to keep.

<<chat "MidnightWhale99"  "SHE'S BACK and we can see her EYES">>

<img src="images/scenes/day_3/day_3_2.png" alt="A screenshot of the stream webcam feed, showing a close-up of Ellie's eyes, framed by long lashes and soft brows, with warm lighting creating tiny shadows on her cheekbones.">

<<chat "ChillVibesOnly"  "ellie!! oh my god your EYES. your LASHES. i'm deceased">>

<<chat "night_owl_cc"  "wait is that her actual face omgggg those eyelashes are UNREAL">>

